      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Not all things are Definite, but we always knew the Moment would arrive, and so it has.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Location_PL_Auroracle_KKS.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Auroracle_POL_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1217924,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "We watched as the Firstworld was destroyed... and wept. Then the Song was sung and the Spiral was woven; we forestalled our sorrow.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Location_PL_Auroracle_KKS.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Auroracle_POL_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1217924,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But that which was frozen, in Time, and in our Hearts, flows again. The first sign is nigh: a Shadow comes to tear Land and Sky asunder.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Location_PL_Auroracle_KKS.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Auroracle_POL_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1217924,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "After, it soon is only a matter of Time. When the Sand settles, the Spiral shall end as it began... with a broken Heart.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Location_PL_Auroracle_KKS.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Auroracle_POL_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1217924,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Hearken to me though. Should the Moment rise, the Sundering shall be Stopped, and the Hastening shall be Slowed.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Location_PL_Auroracle_KKS.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Auroracle_POL_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1217924,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
